          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shigure - 未运行" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shigure — Not running"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shigure 已启动，数据目录: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shigure started. Data directory: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shigure 是荒坂公司（Arasaka Corporation）开发的冲锋枪。有时人们只想把子弹全打出去，在硝烟过后品味眼前的一片狼藉。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shigure is a submachine gun made by the Arasaka Corporation. Sometimes you just want to empty the magazine and savour the mess once the smoke clears."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shigure 通过截取游戏窗口像素来读取插件渲染的状态点阵。画面只在本机内存中解析，不录制、不保存、不上传任何内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shigure captures game window pixels to read the status dots rendered by the addon. Frames are parsed in memory on this Mac only — nothing is recorded, saved, or uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shigure 通过系统事件向游戏进程发送键盘按键。授权后立即生效，无需重启。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shigure sends keyboard events to the game process via system events. Takes effect immediately after granting — no restart needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shigure 需要读取游戏画面并向游戏发送按键才能工作。接下来的几步会引导你在系统设置中授予所需权限，全程约一分钟。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shigure needs to read the game screen and send keystrokes to the game. The next few steps will guide you through granting the required permissions in System Settings — it takes about a minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
